@startuml seq-remote
title Remote check-in

actor Student
participant "Student page" as UI
participant "HTTP API" as API
participant AttendanceService as Att
participant AnomalyDetector as Det

Student -> UI : I'm joining remotely
UI -> API : POST /challenge
API --> UI : challenge id + nonce
UI -> UI : sign the challenge
UI -> API : POST /checkin mode=remote
API -> Att : check_in
Att -> Att : do not accept the acoustic token
Att -> Att : mint a separate external token
Att -> Det : flag both_modes if this student\nis already in class
Det --> UI : remote row, external token,\nconfidence, flags
@enduml
